      <div class="card">
        <h1>SST Quick Send Email</h1>
        <p>Create a Learning Center quick-send email by cloning the header template and injecting your body into the template body slot. Preview below is approximate; greeting, signature, and footer come from the template at send time.</p>
        <script runat="server">
          function bodyHtmlSafe(value) {
            return String(value || "")
              .replace(/&/g, "&amp;")
              .replace(/</g, "&lt;")
              .replace(/>/g, "&gt;")
              .replace(/"/g, "&quot;");
          }
          var bodyResultStatus = Platform.Variable.GetValue("@quickSendEmailResultStatus");
          var bodyResultMessage = Platform.Variable.GetValue("@quickSendEmailResultMessage");
          var bodyAssetId = Platform.Variable.GetValue("@quickSendEmailAssetId");
          var bodyCustomerKey = Platform.Variable.GetValue("@quickSendEmailCustomerKey");
          if (bodyResultStatus) {
            Write('<div class="notice ' + bodyHtmlSafe(bodyResultStatus) + '"><strong>' + bodyHtmlSafe(bodyResultMessage) + '</strong>');
            if (bodyAssetId) {
              Write('<br>Asset ID: ' + bodyHtmlSafe(bodyAssetId));
            }
            if (bodyCustomerKey) {
              Write('<br>Customer Key: ' + bodyHtmlSafe(bodyCustomerKey));
            }
            Write('</div>');
          }
        </script>
        <div class="hub-grid">
          <form method="post" id="quickSendEmailForm">
            <input type="hidden" name="createEmail" value="1">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label" for="emailName">Email Name</label>
              <input class="form-input" id="emailName" name="emailName" value="SST Quick Send Learning Center Email">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label" for="subject">Subject</label>
              <input class="form-input" id="subject" name="subject" value="Recommended Learning Center resources">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label" for="preheader">Preheader</label>
              <input class="form-input" id="preheader" name="preheader" value="Helpful educational resources selected for your practice.">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label" for="introBody">Body</label>
              <textarea class="form-textarea" id="introBody" name="introBody">Thank you for your recent visit to our Learning Center. We hope you found our educational resources helpful in your practice of medicine. Based on your specialty, we thought you might be interested in more of our content.

With our upgraded Learning Center, you can access educational content, including an extensive library offering CME credits, and manage your learning activities more effectively. We are committed to being your trusted partner for professional development and risk management advice.</textarea>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-create" type="submit">Create</button>
          </form>
